# Pinned SHA-256 of Buildroot release tarballs, checked by
# scripts/fetch-buildroot.sh (format: sha256  <hex>  buildroot-<version>.tar.xz).
#
# A version without a line here is verified against the release's .sign
# manifest instead, and fetch-buildroot.sh prints the line to add. Release
# builds (tags) set BUILDROOT_REQUIRE_PIN=1 and refuse unpinned tarballs, so
# pin BUILDROOT_VERSION (Makefile) here after checking the hash against the
# signed manifest:
#   https://buildroot.org/downloads/buildroot-<version>.tar.xz.sign
